        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The ad system now supports a new way to run sponsored tasks directly inside a web browser workspace on a Linux virtual machine, rather than on a user's local computer. A new security rule ensures that project-level environment variables used by these web tasks cannot override critical system settings, preventing a project from hijacking the assistant's behavior. This is an internal infrastructure update to the ad-serving pipeline that prepares the system for future browser-based sponsored tasks; it does not change how you interact with the assistant or your coding sessions today.",
